      "paperId": "2397ecf9f0f5c74926895b149960b458537371b7",
      "title": "Philosophy and Progress: The Challenges and Limitations of the Critical Theory Paradigms",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Ahmed Ben Moussa Serir",
